---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Related programs | Marici"
  description="External, non-authoritative comparisons held apart from the Marici research ledger."
>
  <section class="section-shell" aria-labelledby="related-programs-title">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Guide · External / non-authoritative</p>
        <h1 id="related-programs-title">Related programs.</h1>
      </div>
      <p>
        These are comparison notes, not Marici admissions. Promotion requires a Marici ledger result
        supplying a source object, theorem, computation, or falsifier.
      </p>
    </header>

    <aside class="frontier-card frontier-card--gap" aria-labelledby="promotion-boundary-title">
      <header>
        <p>Admission boundary</p>
        <span>External / non-authoritative</span>
      </header>
      <h2 id="promotion-boundary-title">A citation is not a ledger result.</h2>
      <p>
        Names, analogies, and shared vocabulary remain outside the admitted graph until a Marici
        ledger result supplies a source object, theorem, computation, or falsifier.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <section aria-labelledby="relationship-types-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Comparison vocabulary</p>
          <h2 id="relationship-types-title">Relationship types.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Only the stated relation is being claimed for each external program.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="dimension-grid" aria-label="Available relationship types">
        <li class="dimension-card"><h3><span class="tag">Technical overlap</span></h3></li>
        <li class="dimension-card"><h3><span class="tag">Methodological analogue</span></h3></li>
        <li class="dimension-card"><h3><span class="tag">Competing hypothesis</span></h3></li>
        <li class="dimension-card"><h3><span class="tag">Negative comparator</span></h3></li>
        <li class="dimension-card"><h3><span class="tag">Shared vocabulary only</span></h3></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="program-comparisons-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Finite comparison queue</p>
          <h2 id="program-comparisons-title">Two bounded entries.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Each entry names what can be compared and what must remain outside Marici.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="dimension-grid">
        <article class="dimension-card">
          <header>
            <p class="dimension-role">External program</p>
            <div class="article-meta"><span class="tag">Methodological analogue</span></div>
          </header>
          <h3>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/dp-web4/Synchronism"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >Synchronism</a>
          </h3>
          <p>
            <strong>Marici object compared:</strong> Deutsch–Popperian ledger/falsification and
            reparameterization audit.
          </p>
          <p><strong>Relation:</strong> Methodological analogue.</p>
          <p><strong>Hypothesis update:</strong> No H1/H2/H3 update.</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Finite comparison:</strong> Ask whether the external construction supplies a
            source object, theorem, computation, or falsifier.
          </p>
          <p><strong>Prohibited import:</strong> Planck grid, absolute ticks, or Intent.</p>
          <p>
            <a
              class="text-action"
              href="https://github.com/dp-web4/Synchronism"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >Open Synchronism repository (external)</a>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="dimension-card">
          <header>
            <p class="dimension-role">External program</p>
            <div class="article-meta">
              <span class="tag">Shared vocabulary only</span>
              <span class="tag">Negative comparator</span>
            </div>
          </header>
          <h3>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/LeeHounshell/Aleph-Potential-Theory-and-Ethical-Self-Reflective-AI"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >Aleph Potential Theory</a>
          </h3>
          <p><strong>Marici object compared:</strong> Shared-carrier language only.</p>
          <p><strong>Relation:</strong> Shared vocabulary only; Negative comparator.</p>
          <p><strong>Hypothesis update:</strong> No hypothesis update.</p>
          <p><strong>Finite comparison:</strong> Ask for a typed map or distinguishing computation.</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Prohibited import:</strong> All-pattern ontology or treating containment as
            explanation.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a
              class="text-action"
              href="https://github.com/LeeHounshell/Aleph-Potential-Theory-and-Ethical-Self-Reflective-AI"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >Open Aleph Potential Theory repository (external)</a>
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
